          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: Hlakazekani phakathi kwabantu lithi kibo: Wonke umuntu kalethe inkabi yakhe lemvu yakhe lizihlabele lapha, lidle; lingoni eNkosini ngokudla okulegazi. Ngakho bonke baletha kwaba yilowo lalowo inkabi yakhe ngalobobusuku, bazihlaba khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wayakhela iNkosi ialtare; kwakulialtare lokuqala alakhela iNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasesithi: Asihambeni silandele amaFilistiya ebusuku, siwahlasele kuze kuse, singatshiyi loyedwa kiwo. Bathi: Yenza lokho okubona kulungile. Kodwa umpristi wathi: Asisondeleni kuNkulunkulu khona lapha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wabuza kuNkulunkulu wathi: Ngixotshane lawo amaFilistiya na? Uzawanikela ezandleni zikaIsrayeli na? Kodwa kamphendulanga ngalolosuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasesithi: Sondelani lonke lina bakhokheli babantu, ukuze sibone ukuba lesisono sivele kanjani lamuhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ngifunga iNkosi ekhulula uIsrayeli, loba kunguJonathani indodana yami, uzakufa impela. Kodwa kakho loyedwa owamphendulayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi kuye wonke uIsrayeli: Buyelani nganxanye lina, mina loJonathani indodana yami sizabuyela nganxanye. Abantu bathi kuSawuli: Yenza lokho okubona kulungile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uSawuli wathi: Nkosi, Nkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, kungani ungayiphendulanga inceku yakho lamuhla? Uba isono sikimi kumbe kuJonathani indodana yami, Nkosi, Nkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, inkatho kayibe yiUrimi; kodwa uba isono sisebantwini bakoIsrayeli, inkatho kayibe yiThumimi. UJonathani loSawuli badliwa, kodwa abantu baphunyuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 27:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 28:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasesithi: Yenzani inkatho phakathi kwami lendodana yami uJonathani. UJonathani wadliwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wasesithi kuJonathani: Ngitshele okwenzileyo. UJonathani wasemtshela wathi: Nginambithe inyosi ngesihloko somqwayi ebengiwuphethe; kulungile ngingafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wathi: UNkulunkulu angihlanekele impela ngokwengezelelweyo; uzakufa impela, Jonathani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa abantu basebesithi kuSawuli: Uzakufa yini uJonathani yena elethele uIsrayeli ukunqoba okungaka na? Atshi bo! Sifunga iNkosi, kakuyikuwela phansi lolulodwa unwele lwekhanda lakhe, ngoba usebenze loNkulunkulu lamuhla. Ngakho abantu bamhlenga ekufeni uJonathani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wayekela ukuxotshana lamaFilistiya; amaFilistiya abuyela endaweni yawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho uSawuli esebusa koIsraeli, walwa lezitha zakhe zonke inxa zonke, walwa lamaMowabi, lamaAmoni, lamaEdoma, lamakhosi aseZoba, lamaFilistiya; loba kungaphi lapho aphendukela khona wanqoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza ubuqhawe ngokunqoba amaAmaleki, wakhulula uIsrayeli ezandleni zabaphangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadodana kaSawuli ayengoJonathani loIshivi, loMalikishuwa; amabizo amadodakazi akhe amabili yila, ibizo lenkulu lalinguMerabi, ibizo lencinyane linguMikhali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibizo lomkaSawuli lalinguAhinowama indodakazi kaAhimazi. Ibizo lenduna yempi yakhe lalinguAbineri indodana kaNeri, uyise omncinyane kaSawuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UKishi uyise kaSawuli, loNeri uyise kaAbineri, babengamadodana kaAbiyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakukhona ukulwa okunzima lamaFilistiya zonke insuku zikaSawuli; kwakuthi uSawuli ebona indoda elamandla loba eliqhawe, ayifake ebuthweni lakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
